sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant M as ASimulationManager
    participant G as UScenarioGenerator
    participant P as URoutePlanner
    participant S as ASpacecraft

    Note over UI: UI работает всё время

    activate UI

    UI->>M: GenerateScenario()
    activate M
    M->>G: GenerateScenario()
    activate G
    G-->>M: StarData, PlanetData, SystemBoundary
    deactivate G
    M->>M: CreateBodies()
    M-->>UI: OnScenarioGenerated
    deactivate M
    Note over M: пауза — менеджер свободен

    UI->>M: PlanRoute()
    activate M
    M->>P: Initialize(bodies, params, boundary)
    activate P
    P-->>M: готов
    deactivate P
    M->>P: StartPlanning()
    activate P
    M-->>UI: OnPlanningStarted
    deactivate M
    Note over M: пауза — PlanRoute асинхронный,<br/>менеджер сразу свободен
    Note over P: фоновый поиск
    P-->>M: OnPlanningCompleted(FRoutePlan)
    deactivate P
    activate M
    M-->>UI: OnPlanningCompleted
    deactivate M
    Note over M: пауза

    UI->>M: StartSimulation()
    activate M
    M->>P: GetLastRoute()
    activate P
    P-->>M: FRoutePlan
    deactivate P
    M->>S: InitializeSpacecraft(start, star)
    activate S
    S-->>M: относительное состояние
    deactivate S
    loop Tick — менеджер занят синхронно
        M->>S: IntegrateStep(dt)
        activate S
        S-->>M: RelativePosition / Velocity
        deactivate S
        M->>M: SwitchCentralBody() / Check*()
    end
    M-->>UI: OnLogAdded / состояние
    deactivate M

    deactivate UI
